Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: flickos-archive-keyring
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: OpenPGP key and apt source for the FlickOS package repository
 The public key used to verify packages from the FlickOS apt repository,
 installed to /usr/share/keyrings and referenced with Signed-By so apt trusts
 it only for the FlickOS repository.
 .
 Also configures the repository itself in
 /etc/apt/sources.list.d/flickos.sources, so its address can be updated with
 a new version of this package.
 .
 Automatic updates (unattended-upgrades) install FlickOS's packages too:
 /etc/apt/apt.conf.d/51flickos-origins adds the repository to the origins
 they allow.
